# Biome policy

- Fix lint and format issues in source; do not add `biome.json` overrides or inline suppressions.
- Run `pnpm exec biome ci .` (or `pnpm exec biome check --write <file>` for a single path).
- Match existing style in touched files; let Biome auto-fix formatting when safe.
